\contentsline {table}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces Recommendation latency in process after warming, 150 measurements per method (50 libraries, three requests each), on an 8 core Intel Core i9 11950H with background load. Over real HTTP the decision model takes 53\,ms at the median.}}{32}{table.caption.60}%
